  "title": "Employee Insurances — Create / Edit",
  "entity": "HCMv3.BenefitsManagement.EmployeeInsurance",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>An insurance enrolment for the employee or a dependant, and how its cost is shared and recovered.</p><p>Payroll pays the employee and company contributions in the payroll month in which the insurance starts, then recovers them in instalments from the instalment start date until each balance is cleared. The insurance amount must equal the employee contribution plus the company contribution.</p>",
